{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f2435cb3128061fe","name":"Pinook Fighter","source":{"id":"source:reference-f2435cb3128061fe","title":"Pinook Fighter","revision":20728,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:24:11Z","sha256":"f7a7a1b1086a8f3483f51e99ebd275dae2e04ee663f2afaed8e9205bf1a69bc0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20728","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Pinook%20Fighter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f2435cb3128061fe","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["It is often said that the design of the Pinook Fighter is so bad that it couldn't have happened by accident. Though such statements are meant to be humorous, they are actually true. Built by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Joraan Drive Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Joraan_Drive_Systems?action=edit&redlink=1"},", the Pinook suffered from heavy Imperial restrictions on its available armament, weapons, and power supply.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Since ",{"tag":"a","children":["Joraan Drive Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Joraan_Drive_Systems?action=edit&redlink=1"}," was not a strong supporter of the New Order, its board of directors could not convince Imperial inspectors to allow the Pinook to be sold to allies of the Empire. As a result, the inspectors considered the ship to be a purely civilian craft and saw no need to let the company give it any serious combat ability.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Pinook Fighter is slow, poorly armed, and underpowered. It's inexpensive, but that consideration pales in light of its performance. The ship can be overflown by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Y-Wing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Y-Wing"}," and outgunned by jury-rigged ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ugly Fighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ugly_Fighters?action=edit&redlink=1"}," built from spare parts. The Pinook has seen some success as a training vessel, since it is cheap enough to risk with raw pilots, but no force that fields the ship in combat expects it to do anything but report the presence of an enemy before being destroyed. The sales and performance of the Pinook Fighter are so poor that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Joraan Drive Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Joraan_Drive_Systems?action=edit&redlink=1"}," secretly constructs ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," for criminal organizations just to stay solvent.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Pinook Fighter Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Huge ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +4; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 12 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 11), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 24; +3 Armor\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 75; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.